Danesh packaging probes (Plan 01-09, decision D-23)

These assets exist only to prove that native engines load and run inside packaged, isolated utility processes on
Windows and macOS. They are NOT Danesh's chosen product engines, models or voices, and no quality claim is made for
them. They are fetched at build time by `pnpm probes:fetch` (tools/probes.lock.json pins each commit, size and SHA-256)
and are never downloaded by the app. Revisit before Phase 12.

